<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Sunkyong H1 net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sunkyong H1 net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   137  vs -2,049</p>
<p>    Net					  1.60  vs -18.42</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			1.60  vs -18.42</p>
<p>    Revenue				  366.62  vs 352.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Sunkyong Industry Co Ltd is a monopoly producer of acetate filament yarn. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
